      <section class="ent-hero">
        <h1 class="ent-h1--wide">Tomorrow’s AI workspace, for today’s startups.</h1>
        <p class="ent-lede">OpenShore is the workspace where your team and expert AI workers run the company together, so you can scale the business, not your headcount or your cap table.</p>
        <p class="ent-body ent-hero-why">Every startup is sailing for an open shore. We build the instruments and the crew to get them there.</p>
        <div class="ent-actions">
          <a class="ent-btn ent-btn--primary" href="#design-partners">Become a design partner</a>
